<BaseLayout title="Experiences | Moonlight Manor" description="Explore hiking, cycling and the Upper Karoo around Victoria West.">
  <main><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Beyond the veranda</span><h1>Discover the<br/><em>Upper Karoo.</em></h1></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro-grid"><div class="intro-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Moonlight Hill</span><h2>Take the scenic route.</h2><p>Hiking trails are described behind the property, leading towards views over the Karoo landscape and the historic buildings of Victoria West.</p><p>For guests who prefer to explore on wheels, cycling and golf are also listed among activities in the area.</p><p class="muted">Trail access, safety, route conditions and activity arrangements must be confirmed locally before setting out.</p></div><div class="intro-art" role="img" aria-label="Moonlight Manor garden and veranda" style={`background-image:url("https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/33/19/db/37/caption.jpg?h=1200&s=1&w=1200")`}></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Explore at your own pace</span><h2>Make time for the little things.</h2><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Hiking</h3><p>Ask about the Moonlight Hill trails and local walking routes.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Cycling</h3><p>Discover the quiet roads and open spaces around Victoria West.</p></article><article class="feature"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Local heritage</h3><p>Take time to explore the town’s distinctive Victorian architecture.</p></article></div></div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>